# `db` was excluded here, which is right for the static-site image (it needs
# only dist/) and fatal for db/Dockerfile.migrate — an excluded path is not in
# the build context at ALL, so the migration job's COPY would fail on a file
# that plainly exists in the repo. Nothing COPYs db/ into the static image, so
# including it costs a slightly larger context and no image bytes.

manifest.json
